#: quickbook/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"Quick Booking adds a public booking page for the appointment schedules you already have in the Calendar app. Requires the Calendar app.\n"
"\n"
"Visitors pick a date and time, enter their details, review and confirm on the same page. The appointment is booked immediately and the usual booking confirmation email (with .ics) is sent.\n"
"\n"
"* Share the usual Calendar booking link (\"Copy link\" in the Calendar app): it opens Quick Booking.\n"
"* One-time appointment schedules: offer appointments on one or more chosen dates (e.g. parent-teacher conferences) instead of weekly. Create them in the Calendar app under \"One-time appointment schedules\".\n"
"* Built-in rate limiting of bookings per visitor and per email address.\n"
"* Self-check: verifies after every Calendar or Nextcloud update that it still works, and lets the booking link show the standard Calendar booking page when something breaks."
msgstr ""
"Quick Booking Kalendar ilovasida allaqachon mavjud bo‘lgan uchrashuv jadvallaringiz uchun ommaviy bron qilish sahifasini qo‘shadi. Kalendar ilovasi talab qilinadi.\n"
"\n"
"Tashrif buyuruvchilar bitta sahifaning o‘zida sana va vaqtni tanlaydi, ma’lumotlarini kiritadi, bronni ko‘rib chiqadi va tasdiqlaydi. Uchrashuv darhol bron qilinadi va odatdagi bron tasdig‘i xati (.ics bilan) yuboriladi.\n"
"\n"
"* Kalendarning odatdagi bron havolasini ulashing (Kalendar ilovasidagi \"Havolani nusxalash\"): u Quick Booking sahifasini ochadi.\n"
"* Bir martalik uchrashuv jadvallari: uchrashuvlarni har hafta emas, balki tanlangan bir yoki bir nechta sanada taklif qiling (masalan, ota-onalar va o‘qituvchilar uchrashuvlari). Ularni Kalendar ilovasidagi \"Bir martalik uchrashuv jadvallari\" bo‘limida yarating.\n"
"* Har bir tashrif buyuruvchi va har bir elektron pochta manzili uchun bronlar sonining ichki cheklovi.\n"
"* O‘z-o‘zini tekshirish: Kalendar yoki Nextcloud har safar yangilanganidan keyin ilova hali ham ishlayotganini tekshiradi va biror narsa buzilsa, bron havolasi Kalendarning standart bron qilish sahifasini ko‘rsatadi."

